      185.85,
      230.69,
      377.85,
      255.47
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE CODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDUREACT, NO. 15 OF 1979",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      270.89,
      401.9,
      295.67
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      311.09,
      401.88,
      335.87
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Code of CriminalProcedure (Amendment) Act, No. of 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      351.29,
      401.89,
      402.83
    ],
    "text": "2.The following new section is hereby insertedimmediately after section 122 of the Code of CriminalProcedure Act, No. 15 of 1979 and shall have effect as section122A of that Act:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      418.25,
      401.89,
      563.63
    ],
    "text": "122A. (1) The officer in charge of the policestation who is investigating an offence allegedto have been committed by a child of, or above,twelve years of age and under fourteen years,shall, with the consent of the parent or guardianof such child, cause the child to be examinedby a Government medical officer or any otherexpert in the relevant field, in order to obtain areport which enables the Magistrate havingjurisdiction in the case, to form his opinionwhether such child\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      225.57,
      579.05,
      401.87,
      630.59
    ],
    "text": "(a)has attained sufficient maturity ofunderstanding to judge, of the natureand consequences of the allegedoffence; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      225.57,
      646.13,
      401.85,
      670.79
    ],
    "text": "(b)is in need of any therapeuticintervention.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      410.85,
      351.79,
      452.13,
      399.26
    ],
    "text": "Insertion ofnew section122A in theAct, No. 15of 1979.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0
    ]
  },
